     \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#7d8590\"\n    },\n    \"target\": {\n      \"icon\": \"package\",\n      \"color\": \"#7d8590\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Minimal Outline Icons\n\nThin, quiet outline icons in one soft color. Only the folder and a few key files stand out.\n\nInstall it, then choose **Minimal Outline Icons** in **Settings > File icon theme**.\n\nIt covers about 40 kinds of files and a set of well known folders such as `src`, `docs` and `tests`. It runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}